=== ANALYSIS ===
- Boot is normal through "Net: al_eth1 [PRIME]" — PHY autoneg completes, IP set.
- FAILURE: tftpboot u-boot-chainload.bin -> "Loading: T T T..." = all tftp read
  timeouts (RRQ sent, zero response). Retry exceeded -> stays at stock prompt.
- "Boot: warm" -> this was a WARM (SP805) reset boot, not a cold power-cycle.
- Root cause candidate: eth TX from the box not reaching the host (0 packets seen
  by host tcpdump on udp:69; tftpd log shows no RRQ). Link autoneg "done" but no
  frames flow -> physical/switch/PHY, likely needs the cold power-cycle.
